  "answer": "This is a known bug. Command Palette Dock sits 1 pixel off the screen edge when it is positioned at the top, left or right, so the wallpaper shows through. PowerToys#47652 is the main tracking issue, and the other two reports were closed as duplicates of it. A maintainer said in PowerToys#48446 that a fix is merged and will ship in an upcoming PowerToys release. Update PowerToys to the newest version. Your v0.100.2 may not include the fix yet. Two workarounds have been reported. One user said the gap goes away after restarting PowerToys, but comes back if you toggle the dock off and on. Another user in PowerToys#47700 said the gap doesn't appear when PowerToys runs as Administrator."
 },
